  "skill_summaries": {
    "ultimate": "fire sequential shots at frontal enemies, stunning each",
    "skill1": "normal attacks deal AoE damage",
    "skill2": "prioritize attacking highest-damage-dealt enemy, gaining a buff",
    "skill3": "battle crit damage boost",
    "skill4": "throw grenades at battle start, dealing AoE damage and stunning enemies",
    "skill5": "gain a shield on first hit against the marked target"
  },
  "play_overview": "[[Walker]] fires sequential frontal shots that stun each target hit, while normal attacks deal AoE damage for spread pressure. He prioritizes the highest-damage-dealt enemy, gains a buff on that focus, and throws battle-start grenades for AoE damage and stun. Crit DMG growth adds scaling, and the first hit against the marked target grants a shield. He excels as an opening-burst specialist with sustained stun pressure on a priority target, but stun immunity or poor grenade angles stalls the control chain.",
  "counter_overview": "[[Walker]] opens with grenades that stun and shred Phys DEF, then follows with a fast multi-shot ultimate before placing a bounty on the top damage dealer. The opening chain can decide whether a carry acts. Blunt the ultimate with [[Lily May]], delete [[Walker]] early with high-damage melee like [[Shakir]] or [[Himmel]], and inhibit the marked carry with [[filter:backline-inhibit]] like [[Evie]] or [[Nerion]]. Race the bounty cycle with [[filter:energy-provider]] like [[Thador]] or [[Hugin]]."
